  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDEA-TA for Democratic Strengthening - Electoral Strengthening</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IDEA-Technical st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r demokratisk f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Electoral support by providing technical assistance through IDEA for  strengthening of the national and regional electoral bodies. A        specific aim of the contribution is to improve gender equality in     political participation (candidates) as well among the elected        representatives.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Valst&#xf6;d genom att tillhandah&#xe5;lla tekniskt bist&#xe5;nd genom IDEA f&#xf6;r att  st&#xe4;rka de nationella och regionala valmyndigheterna. Ett specifikt    syfte med insatsen &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldheten i det politiska    deltagandet (kandidater) samt bland de folkvalda representanterna.</narrative>
  </description>
